{%- comment -%}
  ==========================================================
  ARCHIVEOS — ARCHIVE CATALOG HEAD
  RUUD BOY ARCHIVES

  Milestone A. Reserves the architectural space for the future
  Artifact on the collection page — purely structural, no audio,
  no JS, no artwork. The finished Artifact is being built
  separately and will occupy .archive-artifact-mount later.

  Rendered as its own section, immediately before "main" (the
  product grid) in templates/collection.json. Shopify's JSON
  template system renders sections as siblings, not nested — this
  cannot literally wrap the grid — so visual continuity comes from
  sharing .archive-shell / .archive-room with the rest of the
  archive, not from DOM nesting. Same pattern already used to keep
  archive-vitrine / archive-deck (the product page's artifact
  sections) as siblings of their own grid content.

  The mount is deliberately empty: no copy, no default artwork, no
  "awaiting selection" text. archive-vitrine.liquid already owns
  that kind of empty-state design and is intentionally not reused
  here yet — this section only reserves the space and gives it the
  glass-case surface treatment already established in
  archive-shell.css ("THE GLASS MATERIAL").
  ==========================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="archive-room archive-room--tight">
  <div class="archive-shell">
    <div class="archive-section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="archive-eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow }}</p>
        <h2 class="archive-section-head__title">{{ section.settings.title }}</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="archive-artifact-mount archive-glass archive-glass--case"
      data-artifact-mount
      aria-hidden="true"
    ></div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Archive Catalog Head",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-archive-catalog-head",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "Eyebrow",
      "default": "The Holdings"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Title",
      "default": "The Artifact"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Archive Catalog Head"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
